{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "2dd5d0b2857762e00b044bc0ea522fdb6d582c113e82a937db1e630704bfa6b0", "ja": "ふたりは腕利きパーソナリティ", "zh": "两人是实力派主持人", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "62a053d630028abac7b97b6fc08f5b6d081f3fbfb4dc5136fcccc47fa22e041f", "ja": "WEBラジオ『まつりとこのみの年明け\nだけど、年忘れ』初回の視聴者数は上々。\nお悩み相談コーナーではふたりらしさの\n光る回答を繰り出しつつコメント欄の反応も\nうまく拾い、番組は大いに盛り上がる。", "zh": "网络广播《茉莉与木乃美的虽是新年，\n但来辞旧岁吧》首播的观看人数相当可观。\n在烦恼咨询环节中，两人既给出了极具\n自身风格的回答，又巧妙照顾到了评论区的反应，\n节目现场气氛十分热烈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1b3b49a4914d57f4d7227b89925b2bc3c35bbfd4c865e6e2b924db5f3996b789", "ja": "（このみさんとまつりの、WEBラジオ。企画は\n順調に進み、今日がいよいよ生配信初日だ！）", "zh": "（这是由このみ小姐和茉莉主持的网络电台。企划进展顺利，今天终于要迎来首次直播了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "13d5f714dff288c09c331db6023bd7efd43de1916687809c79a2c928f56e6304", "ja": "（宣伝が効いたのか、配信を待機している人も多いな。\nステージの舞台袖とは、また違う緊張感だ……）", "zh": "（看来宣传起作用了，有很多人在等待直播呢。\n和站在舞台侧边时相比，又是另一种紧张感……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "8319cbdf8e8fb483566cf078793e79363a2cb783c51b8fc8fe9c0bd79b4a8e23", "ja": "765プロプレゼンツ！\nまつりと～……。", "zh": "765事务所倾情奉献！\n茉莉和～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "30ca200984c6218eb07a3f7fe2621b43617f14fc6d5b59b3b59c2b75450481f6", "ja": "このみの～……。", "zh": "可奈的～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "6fc22e6fdccf22e9e7707d0b948a3472bb839c6d75c9aeed21dcc6285941ded8", "ja": "『年明けだけど、年忘れ』！", "zh": "『虽然已过新年，但也忘掉旧年吧』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "6fc22e6fdccf22e9e7707d0b948a3472bb839c6d75c9aeed21dcc6285941ded8", "ja": "『年明けだけど、年忘れ』！", "zh": "『虽然已过新年，但也忘掉旧年吧』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "a263f309c56079dfc1f684c3fb976e14f6ee478bcec3186a08d85659d3e14050", "ja": "リスナーのみんな、聞こえてるかしら？\nパーソナリティの馬場このみよ！", "zh": "各位听众，能听到吗？\n我是主持人马场木实哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "988740dd3e9d492a04ac721b82237044b19ba40310e380341561d3a62f8af3e3", "ja": "同じくパーソナリティの、徳川まつりなのです。\nリスナーのみんな、はいほー！", "zh": "同为主持人的德川茉莉是也。\n听众朋友们，嗨吼～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1008_null", "source_sha256": "fcead4f9efc739c3e1de46da4bf1e6b32aeb74bddd98ab9fe91259ed340d1679", "ja": "『はいほー！！！！！』", "zh": "“嗨——！！！！！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1009_null", "source_sha256": "1e4fdd6837a4c58e15c913db3c6d9394885768b953d3943db6af40b09f0799b1", "ja": "『ちゃんと聞こえてるよー！！』", "zh": "『都好好听到了哦——！！』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1010_null", "source_sha256": "9790998447a27964a93f8b0c005d5e98cbeb61bc4cf887ab2fb9ea0d6ac7f0e2", "ja": "『こういう配信、待ってた～！』", "zh": "『一直在等这样的直播～！』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "2c847b2192a5d55604dba6bd6960cce3830289dd463151f1c1557449cd40176b", "ja": "あっ、早速コメントが来てるわね！　ラジオに\nリアルタイムで反応をもらえるのって、新鮮ね！", "zh": "啊，马上就有评论发过来了！能在广播节目中实时收到大家的反馈，感觉真新鲜啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "99a132a046b7cc714e111a9c2b336b31738bc7981689f5dacdf89cea09685a80", "ja": "それに、視聴者数もわかっちゃうのです。みんな、\nまつり達のラジオを楽しみにしていたのですー！", "zh": "而且还能知道观看人数。大家都一直期待着小祭和小此木的广播呢——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "ac2dbafd15ab4cd747a54036b09d382d5a00b52b3c229ec935c8b8763cdec3b7", "ja": "『まつりとこのみの年明けだけど、年忘れ』は、\nリスナーのみんなのお悩みを聞く配信よ。", "zh": "“茉莉与木乃美的虽是年初，却要忘年会”，\n是倾听各位听众烦恼的直播哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "92008f266eb5c7412bdd2626fb0edde34adfbe9dbc06833989e55536236c9166", "ja": "姫とこのみちゃんでみんなのお悩みを聞いて、\n改めて、明るい年明けをお届けするのです！", "zh": "由公主和木美倾听大家的烦恼，\n再次为大家送上一个明朗的新年！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "0b4cb3d75da9e2290e2136010b4e7035be32dd79df7c197fbc05107b43f35f91", "ja": "それじゃあ事前に募集していたおたより、\n読んでいきましょうか！", "zh": "那么接下来，就来读读事先征集到的来信吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "a9d6a5c0e94781b7d3a5e8dc07efd7e8ad2d4841db43e6b2501dd02f9e0cd946", "ja": "ええと……「何度も浮気されて傷付いたのに、\n気が付くと連絡を待っている自分がいます……」", "zh": "呃……“明明被一次又一次地背叛，受了伤，\n可回过神来，却发现自己还在等待那个人的消息……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1017_021mat", "source_sha256": "45b1eb8f125314d56ca639828e259e2aee7973ad83642c146e8397d168b5cd68", "ja": "「ダメだとわかっているのに、どうしても\nその人の事が忘れられません。つらい年明けです……」", "zh": "「虽然明白这样不行，却怎么也\n忘不掉那个人。真是个痛苦的开年……」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "6dcea95c6b659797273b437496fe67fb173f23529744487ec0abcc19035e3373", "ja": "忘れられない恋……\n最初から、なかなかヘビーなおたよりね……。", "zh": "难忘的恋情啊……\n一开始就是挺沉重的一封来信呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "0902cfb27bd4d8a58e6641388e12b998a5ab32d9235f3dd5a24a425cb712ccaa", "ja": "恋人がいるのに何度も浮気するなんて……\nそんなの絶対に、めっ！　なのです！", "zh": "明明有恋人，却还要一次次出轨……\n这种行为绝对不可以！ unerquicklich！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1020_039kon", "source_sha256": "9a6d6e573cc768afe9d35c99d5eea1ea3d76f6782a00f9e14a78fca685e01271", "ja": "そうね。そんな相手は、忘れるのが一番！\n……だけど、それが出来ないから悩んでるのよね。", "zh": "是啊。那种对象，忘掉才是最好的选择！\n……可是，正因为做不到才会烦恼嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1021_021mat", "source_sha256": "a2fe0f2ec14f19d414f627df0902e4e06466e28a09cd263c3b114e61bca8ab66", "ja": "う～ん……あっ！　だったら、姫たちの劇場で、\nステージを見るといいのです！", "zh": "嗯～……啊！那样的话，就来姬姬们的剧场看看舞台吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1022_021mat", "source_sha256": "f69fdbf6ad35b9924ec9aea45e7e5e1c922e7421818133cf7592141d722b5746", "ja": "その相手より何倍も何十倍も、姫たちがあなたを、\n楽しく、夢中にさせてみせるのです♪", "zh": "姬会让你比和那个人在一起时开心几十倍、几百倍，彻底沉浸其中♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1023_021mat", "source_sha256": "7a683da9006b520a5d7f3f59eec27e2f0262786d6f331531500d16f3cc84439d", "ja": "まつりは絶対に、あなたを悲しい気持ちになんて\nさせないのです。……ね？", "zh": "小公主绝对不会让你感到难过的。……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1024_039kon", "source_sha256": "dc2bb3c23fbcccbb34d94dd6f681cccd07aec8d1d90e9970e60505380f4b4488", "ja": "まつりちゃん……さすがね！\nその回答、アイドルの鑑だわ……！", "zh": "小祭……不愧是你！\n这个回答，真不愧是偶像的典范……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1025_039kon", "source_sha256": "fcaeb2b62ef5b048accc720eb5c772bda8022958f39a773852f8bb11f7ba9638", "ja": "それなら、お姉さんも約束しちゃう！　私の\nアダルティな魅力で、あなたを癒やしてあげるわ♪", "zh": "既然这样，大姐姐也答应你！　用我成熟的魅力来治愈你吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1026_null", "source_sha256": "25d857bbc33b7c6408c2388736a199b7a0e86e075bf45a1421ac57c8a2214a1e", "ja": "『あ～～～～～～～～～すき……』", "zh": "『啊～～～～～～～～～好喜欢……』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1027_null", "source_sha256": "2ca9363560eaee27281a120870378824693614de48125f37aa56f9edb6b89b56", "ja": "『つらい時、推しがいるだけで\n乗り越えられることはあるからな～』", "zh": "『毕竟难熬的时候，光是有本命在\n就能挺过去呢～』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1028_null", "source_sha256": "4ab53e9f1e8ae4c6978bab5d47ec6d65870579cdc600b2211f3baf0faaa5f023", "ja": "『この悩みに『私を推せ』で返せるの、\nさすがアイドルすぎる……』", "zh": "“能用‘来粉我吧’来回应这种烦恼，\n真不愧是偶像啊……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1029_p", "source_sha256": "2581e03d61407b5abafdc5b7e39b3f592033bc487bc5ad9593133f6e7becf1b3", "ja": "（コメント欄も、いい感じの盛り上がりだ。\nこの調子なら、問題ないかな……）", "zh": "（评论区的气氛也热烈得不错。照这个势头，应该没问题吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1030_039kon", "source_sha256": "7a47348366199b8a9c17bb28d892fc0bc379f30836e701afeca0d22f07a748c2", "ja": "「僕は頼まれると断れない性格です。細々とした\n仕事でも、積み重なると結構しんどくて……」", "zh": "“我是那种别人一拜托就拒绝不了的性格。琐碎的\n工作就算再小，堆积起来也相当吃不消……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1031_039kon", "source_sha256": "1cbe015ae18afefa8d2165730f74c724747dbfd78579c1f4912fcd05841475fe", "ja": "「新年からは業務拡大するらしく……\n今から仕事始めが憂鬱でたまりません」", "zh": "「听说从新年开始要扩大业务……\n光是想到现在就要开始工作，我就郁闷得不得了」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1032_021mat", "source_sha256": "3d3851f390b219a2f65fa3b3a1a482a145db9b08bf8f2e89e94e0bf970d53115", "ja": "はっきり物事が言えない……\nみんな、悩んでいるのですね。", "zh": "没法把话说得直白……\n大家都在烦恼呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1033_039kon", "source_sha256": "395f8d89c8566a1324b3bb65e1ad095544a2aba31bbf977ecbf5c2d1363a267d", "ja": "元会社員として、共感しちゃうわ……。\n仕事を断れなくて～なんて、あるあるだもの。", "zh": "作为一名前公司职员，我很有共鸣呢……\n因为没法拒绝工作什么的，实在是太常见了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1034_039kon", "source_sha256": "8f8f4b5416c488775192650193aa2ea961ed0d297543aba64d41e4bf80d0186b", "ja": "でもこれは、セクシーの応用で\n解決することが出来ると思うの！", "zh": "不过，我觉得这个问题可以运用性感来解决！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1035_021mat", "source_sha256": "1b487f86f884b3292c4c1255d9a2b23f8c2f1bc8c4775428b0ff383062807cd9", "ja": "ほ……？\nセクシーの応用……なのです？", "zh": "咦……？\n将性感灵活运用……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1036_039kon", "source_sha256": "fe7cbba86317682e0eaf5ed60f511ded7ac627028b05a7ff28554305625e63d8", "ja": "ええ！　露出が多いことがセクシーじゃないの。\n最も効果的なところで見せる、それがセクシー……。", "zh": "没错！露出多并不代表性感。\n在最有效果的地方展现出来，那才叫性感……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1037_039kon", "source_sha256": "65fc180c4b1175973854200237df53ddb6b1ad4600b952e7b4cf43079c571ef7", "ja": "つまり……自分のこなした業務や勤務時間を、\n日々記録しておくのが大切ってことよ！", "zh": "也就是说……每天记录自己完成的工作和工作时间，是很重要的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1038_null", "source_sha256": "efe2a1c9fcd748870eaae4bb6f11c4b872e67ee013176ff7c8324c36b7987393", "ja": "『セクシーの応用が、意外に実用的だと……？』", "zh": "“性感”的灵活运用，竟然意外地实用……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1039_null", "source_sha256": "4a6509c4dbefb860bcf32852ed9152dad983e46b83a94f0ca736e6b444b4920c", "ja": "『確かに。いざという時のために\n証拠を残しておくのは大事だと思う』", "zh": "确实。我觉得为了以防万一，留下证据是很重要的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1040_039kon", "source_sha256": "3d7e13b39fc10c2bfaf89c6c70a555e8208dd464a1251f483ac2ef5a25e3a326", "ja": "そうなの！\nそれに、証拠ってだけじゃなくて……。", "zh": "就是嘛！\n而且，不只是为了留下证据……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1041_039kon", "source_sha256": "dac63adf82480b434d93e3341288f409e9889c01aecf7d402fa13aaf2c04d6ed", "ja": "もしかしたら、あなたの辛さに、周りが\n気付けていないだけかもしれないでしょ？", "zh": "说不定只是周围的人没能察觉到你的辛苦，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1042_039kon", "source_sha256": "982748d6e8d8a17d12ea4f0d399dbe3cba9a431eea86bcceba487a72eedf0658", "ja": "細々だったとしても、誠実に仕事をしたんだもの。\nなら、ちゃんと知っておいてもらわなくちゃ。ね♪", "zh": "哪怕只是做些不起眼的工作，我也一直诚实地完成了。既然如此，就一定要让大家好好知道才行。对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1043_null", "source_sha256": "a4cfbe550249126b9f28679d69d1e45757b9d64fe26bccaf58dbda637b499d19", "ja": "『大人の対応だ……相談者じゃないのに、\n聞いてて心が軽くなった気がする』", "zh": "“这是成年人的处理方式……明明我不是来咨询的，听着却感觉心情轻松了些。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1044_null", "source_sha256": "281442d198620589512fe416019c6506cbbf4ec3e78995b8f95cdb10de431a22", "ja": "『この企画、このみさんと相性最高じゃない？\n俺も、おたより送る！！！！！！』", "zh": "“这个企划，和木实姐的相性不是绝配吗？\n我也要投稿！！！！！！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1045_null", "source_sha256": "7b7123a154d272977a1ccea4de6ad2e09c326433a51c9079756c4210f8f4426a", "ja": "『このみさん、こういうところは\n文句なしでアダルティなんだよな』", "zh": "“木实小姐在这些地方，\n可真是无可挑剔的成熟性感啊”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1046_039kon", "source_sha256": "8a4252e0c9902bb5db68f4dce4fdbebb6991138d415a583b3d4ce3037cf8ea1b", "ja": "……ん？　今、まるで私にアダルティじゃない部分が\nあるかのようなコメントが流れなかった！？", "zh": "……嗯？刚才是不是闪过了一条弹幕，\n说得就好像我还有不够成熟的地方似的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1047_021mat", "source_sha256": "c1bda819fcd69f84ba8d19e1117fcc6c306d6ce5e3edb5585fe328a72a447e77", "ja": "このみちゃん、次は曲のコーナーなのですよ！\n曲紹介、よろしくお願いするのです♪", "zh": "木实，接下来是歌曲环节哦！\n歌曲介绍就拜托你啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1048_p", "source_sha256": "3fbd3f91d56f62f989ad03c2a12e0f04e9a0f6b5e90c0b54806a383558b5228a", "ja": "（コメントの流れも、上手く制御できている。\n相談にも緩急をつけているし……）", "zh": "（评论的走向也控制得很好。连咨询都安排得张弛有度……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_02_1049_p", "source_sha256": "bfb1b518597fc3ca6f8ea586b984d3152882fc7856945a84d0cf4ca659e0431c", "ja": "（WEBラジオ配信でのお悩み相談……\nふたりに任せて正解だったな！）", "zh": "（网络电台直播中的烦恼咨询……交给她们两个果然没错！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
